# .tokenignore
# Patterns of files to ignore for the pre-commit 5,000 token limit check.
# (Tokens = bytes / 4, so the limit is 20,000 bytes)
#
# Default ignore patterns (lockfiles, media, migrations, agent-context artifacts,
# and files with @generated / DO NOT EDIT headers) are already built-in.
# Add any additional project-specific generated or third-party files below.

# Example patterns:
# vendor/
# *.generated.ts
# path/to/large-data.json
